# ==============================================================================
# aws_example.tf.example : Real-world AWS Infrastructure Reference Example
# ==============================================================================
# (This file is for reference. Rename to .tf when ready to deploy to actual AWS)
#
# Prerequisites for real AWS deployment:
# 1. Install & configure AWS CLI (`aws configure` with Access Key & Secret Key)
# 2. Uncomment the "aws" provider block in versions.tf and providers.tf

